  "prose": [
    {
      "title": "Usage",
      "text": "`PillsInput` is a utility component that can be used to create custom tag inputs, multi selects and\nother similar components. By itself it does not include any logic, it only renders given children.\nUsually, `PillsInput` is used in combination with [Pill](/core/pill) component.",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Searchable select example",
      "text": "Combine `PillsInput` with [Combobox](/core/combobox) to create searchable multiselect:",
      "format": "md"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accessibility",
      "text": "If `PillsInput` is used without label prop, it will not be announced properly by screen reader:\n\nSet `aria-label` on the `PillsInput.Field` component to make the input accessible.\nIn this case label will not be visible, but screen reader will announce it:\n\nIf `label` prop is set, the input will be accessible it is not required to set `aria-label`:",
      "format": "md"
    }
  ],
